109","role":"问郤正太子所习读并其情性好尚，再问欲知其权略智调何如","evidence":["duzhou-q-896e9fc28382dc9000da"]},{"person":"houzhu-p0019","role":"秘书郎，数从孟光咨访，答以太子奉亲虔恭、夙夜匪懈，有古世子之风，接待群僚出于仁恕","evidence":["duzhou-q-896e9fc28382dc9000da"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["duzhou-q-896e9fc28382dc9000da"]},"ordering_evidence":"duzhou-q-896e9fc28382dc9000da","source_order":[42,134,0],"order":7510},{"id":"duzhou-e-o045","title":"孟光论储君读书","accounts":[{"id":"duzhou-a-accc7db43c2684675966","label":"正文","text":"孟光论储君读书","evidence":["duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0109","role":"言天下未定智意为先，储君读书当务其急，宁当效竭力博识以待访问、如博士探策讲试以求爵位，又自言好直言每弹射利病为世人所讥嫌","evidence":["duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e"]},{"person":"houzhu-p0019","role":"答以世子之道在承志竭欢，权略智调焉可预设，深谓孟光之言为然","evidence":["duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e"]},"ordering_evidence":"duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e","source_order":[42,135,0],"order":7511},{"id":"duzhou-e-o046","title":"孟光免官，后年九十余卒","accounts":[{"id":"duzhou-a-368d8e853b794aef4070","label":"正文","text":"孟光因事免官，后卒，年九十余。","evidence":["duzhou-q-6c59f78d13fa8d9c2184","duzhou-q2-67fc493a1e47d2bd1be2"]},{"id":"duzhou-a-9d1ba30d66ca3a8081ca","label":"正文","text":"孟光因事免官，后卒，年九十余。","evidence":["duzhou-q-314efce06f1f7840d4c6","duzhou-q2-67fc493a1e47d2bd1be2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0109","role":"坐事免官；年九十余卒","evidence":["duzhou-q-6c59f78d13fa8d9c2184","duzhou-q-314efce06f1f7840d4c6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["duzhou-q-6c59f78d13fa8d9c2184","duzhou-q-314efce06f1f7840d4c6"]},"ordering_evidence":"duzhou-q-6c59f78d13fa8d9c2184","source_order":[42,136,0],"order":7512}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0109","name":"孟光","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o064","duzhou-q-05b30d0